    {
      "id": "a803bf3e-759e-4c82-9ff5-cb0ee86066c6",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "## 1.Rules for identifiers\r\n\r\nAn identifier:\r\n\r\n- Can contain letters\r\n- Can contain digits\r\n- Can contain _  and $ , other than these two , no other symbols are allowed\r\n- Cannot start with a digit\r\n- Cannot be a Java keyword\r\n- Is case-sensitive\r\n- It cant contain any spaces\r\n\r\nValid:- \r\n\r\nage\r\nstudentName\r\nstudent1\r\n_student\r\n$price\r\n\r\nInvalid:- \r\nage\r\nstudentName\r\nstudent1\r\n_student\r\n$price",
      "metadata": {
        "language": "markdown",
        "id": "a803bf3e-759e-4c82-9ff5-cb0ee86066c6"
      }
    },
